@style(IDocDemo)
@title(Signing and forms)

Signature fields, initials, dates and signature checks.

@section(Signing)

@subsection(@@sign)

Where a signer signs: a box for a drawn or typed signature, for one role (student, teacher, parent…).

@sign(name=student, role=student)

@sign(name=ta, role=teacher, label="Witnessed by", after=student)

@sign(Student, required)

@subsection(@@initials)

A box for a signer's initials, for one role: signed like a signature, drawn or typed, and required before that signer can sign.

@initials(name=page2, role=student)

@initials(Reviewer, label=Initial here, after=Author, required)

@subsection(@@signdate)

The date a signer signs, filled in automatically with the day of the signature; the offline checker refuses any other date.

@signdate(role=student)

@signdate(name=student-date, label=Date signed, after=Student, required)

@subsection(@@signfield)

A field the signer fills before signing: text for words (an emergency contact, a student ID) or check for a box; required makes it a condition of signing.

@signfield(text, name=contact, role=student, label="Emergency contact")

@signfield(check, name=photos, role=parent, label="Photos may be taken")

@signfield(Witness, after=Student, required)

@subsection(@@signcheck)

A box the signer ticks, such as "I agree to the rules"; required means they cannot sign without ticking it.

@signcheck(name=agree, role=student, label="I agree to the rules", required)

@signcheck(Reviewer, after=Student)
